// when and doE equivalence (section 2.4.1)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix I (KScript and KSWorld), section 2.4.1, lead-in 'The following two lines are equivalent', PDF page 24 (printed page 23)
// Also printed in: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix II (Making Applications in KSWorld), section 2.4.1, boxed snippet 'The following two lines are equivalent', PDF page 40 (printed page 39)
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.

beeper <- when mouseDown then this.beep()
beeper <- mouseDown.doE(() -> this.beep())

